AR_TRACKER_DIR. Sites the plan explicitly routes to ReconcilerSettings.tracker_dir (AC1/AC2/AC5/AC7) may still break under an env-only relocation.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"feffa79448cbdef2c","impact":0.85,"is_primary":null,"location":"Definition of Done / DD1; ACs 1,2,5,7","norm_id":"n5fcaf8a81e3f5e0e","priority":0.1889,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Deployed MCP server sets REBAR_TRACKER_DIR but leaves tracker.dir at default; a fix routes AC1/AC2/AC5/AC7 through ReconcilerSettings.tracker_dir; those paths continue composing repo_root/.tickets-tracker despite the fix being 'done'"],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"State in DD1 that ReconcilerSettings.tracker_dir is acceptable ONLY if runtime._resolve_tracker_dir is first updated to honour REBAR_TRACKER_DIR with the same env-wins precedence as config.tracker_dir() (or that the snapshot capture already injects the env override into tracker.dir); otherwise route those sites through config.tracker_dir().","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2222,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}}],"impact_model_version":"plan-v5